description:
Luxury Getaway in Estela.
Discover the exclusivity and comfort of our luxury V3 villa, a unique space where privacy and sophistication meet. Located just 3 km from the beach and 2.5 km from the prestigious Estela Golf Club, this property offers everything for an unforgettable stay. 
Private pool with cover;
Exclusive golf putting green;
Play area for fun moments;
Fully equipped kitchen and enclosed outdoor barbecue...;

• Free basement parking;
• 1 min walking distance to the metro station Matosinhos Camara;
• 15 mins by walking or 1 stop to the Matosinhos beach by metro;
• 20 mins to Porto old town by metro;
• Full equipped kitchen;
• 2 bedrooms with 2 bathrooms; 
• Air conditioned heating and cooling;
• Super market on the ground floor.

WHAT YOU MUST KNOW:
// Located in the HEART of Porto (NEXT to Ribeira!)
// Great accessibility (Close to S. Bento station)
// Stylish decoration
// Hosts ALWAYS available for support
// Free WiFi + CableTV + Netflix
// Equipped with Self Check-in
// Included: linens, coffee, hairdryer and more...
// Baby cot is available under request for 35€/stay.
__
WARNING: Water heater is tight for 4 or more people, please manage the time of each bath to make sure the hot water does not run out.

Shared women's room:
- Bed linen included;
- Towel (rental €2);
- Access to 4 WCs;
- Kitchenette;
- Common area with TV.

Apartment (T2) located on the seafront, between Póvoa de Varzim and Vila do Conde.
Living Room with open kitchen;
Two bathrooms.
Free public parking in front of the building;
Top floor of a 3-story building (no elevator);
On the Portuguese Coastal Way (Camiño de Santiago)
Capacity: 4 adults (1 double bed / 2 single beds)

WHAT YOU MUST KNOW:
// Located in the centre of Porto
// Lovely and sunny private backyard
// Hosts ALWAYS available for support
// Free WiFi + CableTV + Netflix availablee to use with your own account
// Extra bed in the living room for the 3rd guest
// Included: linens, coffee, hairdryer and more...
// Baby cot is available under request for 35€/stay.
// Reservations for more than 16 nights might have to pay the electricity bill separately (read more below)

Spacious, comfortable and perfect for families or groups, this apartment offers a cozy atmosphere in a quiet area of the city. 
Close to gardens, culture, shops and services, it provides a practical and relaxing stay.
Nearby:
A 10-minute walk to Jardim de Arca D'Água and Quinta do Covelo;
Less than 10 minutes by car from Boavista and Casa da Música;
15-minute drive to Avenida dos Aliados and Palácio de Cristal.

Modern, bright and minimalist, this apartment in Bonfim offers a comfortable and quiet stay. It has a balcony, AC and fast WiFi.
Located in an authentic residential area, it is close to several points of interest such as:
- 10-minute drive from Rua Santa Catarina and Bolhão Market;
- 18-minute drive from the Crystal Palace;
Mobility is easy, with the subway and buses just a few minutes' walk away.
Ideal for those seeking autonomy, comfort and good connection to the city center.

Shared 6-bed bunk room (10-minute walk to the airport)
- Bedding included;
- Towels (rent €2)
- Kitchenette;
- Beds with presence light;
- Lockers with key (included);
- Toilets.

Typical bourgeois house of the late 19th century, early 20th century.
// Air-conditioning
// Private bathroom (suite)
// Access to a spacious garden with great sun exposure
// Parking available (garage €15/day)
// Store your luggage before and after your stay
// Free check-in until 8 p.m. (a fee will be charged after this time or we will arrange for a self check-in)
// Guest support always available
// Crib upon request € 35/stay

40 m² studio with outdoor area in the heart of Ribeira! Complete, renovated, best value for money.
. 100% self-check-in - arrive whenever you want!
. Outdoor area with barbecue area;
Thermal towel rail – dry, warm towels in winter!
. Air-conditioned environment - hot/cold AC;
. Comfortable bed;
. High-quality bed/bath linens;
. Shower like the one at home;
. SmartTV;
. Full kitchen;
. Home office/dining table space.
Feel at home after a day of exploring Porto's alleys!

