// Baby cot is available under request for 35€/stay.

Modern and comfortable, this studio is ideal for those who value independence and total autonomy. Equipped with a balcony, air conditioning, free parking and a 24-hour doorman, it offers a practical, safe and pleasant stay.
Highlights:
View of Estádio do Dragão;
Direct access to Alameda Shopping;
500 m from the Dragão metro station;
300 m from several bus lines;
10–15 minutes by transport from the city center;
Next to the VCI, it allows quick connections to the entire city.

- My place is close to:
Airport (10 min);
Bus (5 min);
Metro 15 min);
Beach (20 min).
Downtown Maia and Porto (30 min);
The space is located in a quiet residential development with green spaces and children's parks.
There are several cafés, bakeries, restaurants, supermarkets, shopping malls, pharmacies and hospitals.
My place is good for couples, solo adventurers, and business travelers.
- Come and go
Availability (with notice) for transportation to and from

This place stays on a rural side of the city, where you will create good memories and have some fun.
This house is near of Ferreira´s River Park with over 100.000m2, where you can walk, do some exercise, running and appreciate Nature.
• 34 km from the municipality of Porto;
• 9.7 km from the A4 highway;
• 7.4 km from the A41 highway;
• 11 km from the A42 highway;
• 5 km from national road nº15 in Gandra;
