+ Porto city center: 2 min to the metro station;
+ 2 Bedrooms with comfortable double beds;
+ Bed linens and towels included;
+ Self Check-in for late arrival.
+ Low-cost monitored parking 10 minutes away.

This magnificent accommodation is located on Rua das Cavadas in Rio Tinto, on the outskirts of Porto; 
Residential and very quiet area;
About 2 minutes from Rio Tinto train station, 4 minutes from the bus stop and 3 minutes from Campaínha Metro. 
The subway station can take you to the heart of the beautiful city of Porto and even to the beach. 
There is a bakery down the street and a mini-market.
It is 5 minutes (by car) from the Parque Nascente mall, and you can also go by subway.

- 50 m from the beach and Sr. da Pedra;
- 700 m from the train station;
- 1 km from Golf club;
It has 4 +1 rooms, of which 2 are suites, 2 full equiped bathrooms and two basic bathrooms (no shower). It has a properly sized garden with barbecue set, exterior dinning table and chaise longues. The house was under works to improve things such as insulation, replace all roof tiles, windows and shutters and exterior painting, among other things.
Central heating fee: 29 eur/day (min 3 days)

