Kimia Casa-Porto is an apartment located in the heart of Porto, which privileges the comfort and well-being of the guest. This apartment offers all the necessary amenities to a stay of an excellent quality and memorable adventure in one of the most beautiful cities of Europe. 
Other points of interest for 3 minutes walk:
Famous street Sta.Ctarina;
Magestic Café;
Bolhão Metro sation;
Bolhão Market;
Coliseun of Porto;
So come and stay at Kimia Casa-Porto and you will LOVE it !!!!

→ The Jacuzzi is unavailable from November to March.
Enjoy this contemporary and comfortable apartment. It's perfect for your stay while exploring the city of Porto. Thanks to its large windows in all rooms, the apartment is quite bright and airy. 
For your comfort, the beds are distributed as follows:
→ A double bed in the 1st Bedroom; 
→ A double bed in the 2nd Bedroom;

_____
